<title>JAPAN: NIPPON ZEON FILES 30 BLN YEN SHELF REGISTRATION.</title>
<headline>NIPPON ZEON FILES 30 BLN YEN SHELF REGISTRATION.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Zeon Co Ltd said on Friday it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 30 billion yen of corporate bonds, effective for two years from August 13.</p>
</text>
